|desc=A giant hand appears and attempts to bull rush one target. The hand gains a +14 bonus on the [[strength]] check. A target that is bull rushed is knocked down and is [[dazed]] for the duration of the spell.}}

== Notes ==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*The bull rush works as follows: caster rolls 1d20 + 14 versus the target's roll of 1d20 + target's [[ability modifier|strength modifier]] + target's [[size modifier]].
*Many claim this is the single most powerful spell for [[PvP]], because of its long duration and difficulty to resist, particularly for non-strength builds.

